  << /ActualText (Mood Muse\nCommunication Aid for Autistic Children\nDesigned a communication aid that helps autistic children express emotions through color\055based interaction\056\n\042 Translated physiological signals into color for nonverbal expression\n\042 Applied art therapy principles to support emotional communication\n\042 Helped externalize internal emotional states through accessible cues\n\042 Prototyped with Rhino\054 Keyshot\054 Arduino\054 Processing\054 and FDM printing)
